          "verdict": "issue",
          "quote": "Person is the ordinary word for one human: a kind person, three people. Individual is formal, or stresses one person as separate from a group: the rights of the individual. Human, or human being, is used when people are contrasted with animals, machines, or gods: the first humans.",
